WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Every contract has a LIFE.

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.790
It's born... it gets tested...

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.670
and one day — it ends.

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.200
It's BORN when everything lines up

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.500
— two parties,

6
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.560
an offer, acceptance,

7
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.620
agreement, intention... and capacity.

8
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.430
Then — the health check.

9
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.170
Illegal? Both mistaken?

10
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.130
That's VOID... it never really lived.

11
00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.410
But a lie that tricked you

12
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.190
in? VOIDABLE — it lives,

13
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.950
until someone sets it aside.

14
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.500
And every contract ends.

15
00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.080
Natural causes — both sides did

16
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.000
their part. Old age — five

17
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.360
years with no claim.

18
00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:50.000
Or an accident nobody caused...

19
00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.600
that's frustration.

20
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.710
But sometimes... it's foul play.

21
00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.550
Someone BREAKS it.

22
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.930
Then the court can award damages...

23
00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:04.750
order them to do it —

24
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:06.970
or make them stop.

25
00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:10.520
Born. Tested. Ended.

26
00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.180
That's the life...

27
00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.500
of a contract.
